              <span class="media">
                <img src="/playground/bioluminescent-flow.webp" alt="Glowing particle trails on a dark field, from Bioluminescent Flow" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360" />
              </span>
              <h3>Bioluminescent Flow</h3>
              <div class="whisper">
                <p class="meta">2026 &middot; live &middot; experiment</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="entry entry--half" data-id="webcam-magic" data-kind="experiment" data-cat="">
            <a class="tile" href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/webcam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="media">
                <img src="/playground/webcam-magic.webp" alt="A face rendered as a pixel mirror, from Webcam Magic" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360" />
              </span>
              <h3>Webcam Magic</h3>
              <div class="whisper">
                <p class="meta">2026 &middot; live &middot; experiment</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="entry entry--half" data-id="the-line-before" data-kind="finished" data-cat="game">
            <a class="tile" href="https://divya.studiotypo.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="media">
                <img src="/playground/the-line-before.webp" alt="A scene from The Line Before" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360" />
              </span>
              <h3>The Line Before</h3>
              <div class="whisper">
                <p class="meta">2025 &middot; live &middot; game &middot; with Kahran Singh</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="entry entry--full" data-id="unseen" data-kind="ongoing" data-cat="photocomics illustration">
            <div class="tile">
              <span class="media strip">
                <img src="/projects/2024/(un)seen Istanbul/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Istanbul cover, drawing over a street photograph" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" />
                <img src="/projects/2025/(un)seen Emirates/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Emirates cover, drawing over a street photograph" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" />
                <img src="/projects/2026/(un)seen Life/cover.webp" alt="(un)seen Life cover, drawing over a street photograph" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" />
              </span>
              <h3>(un)seen</h3>
              <div class="whisper">
                <p class="meta">2024 to now &middot; ongoing &middot; photocomics, illustration</p>
                <p class="note">I draw into photographs of streets I'd have walked straight past, until I can't walk past them anymore.</p>
              </div>
              <a class="out-link" href="https://divyatak.github.io/creative-visuals/lenticular/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the lenticular edition &#8594;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="entry entry--line" data-id="the-titli-effect" data-kind="finished" data-cat="game">
            <div class="tile">
              <h3><a href="/works/the-titli-effect/">The Titli Effect</a></h3>
              <div class="whisper">
                <p class="meta">2024 &middot; game &middot; with my sister Charu</p>
                <p class="note">2nd place, Jennifer Ann Group Connectedness jam</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="entry entry--half" data-id="journey-of-my-paper-plane" data-kind="finished" data-cat="game illustration">
            <a class="tile" href="/works/journey-of-my-paper-plane/">
              <span class="media">
                <img src="/projects/2024/Journey of my paper plane/cover.webp" alt="Journey of my paper plane cover" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360" />
              </span>
